WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.840
Hey, I'm Eric, and first of all, I wanted to thank you for booking an in-home visit

00:04.840 --> 00:06.560
with Say When Contracting.

00:06.560 --> 00:10.480
I recorded this video to walk you through what comes next so that you know exactly what

00:10.480 --> 00:13.200
to expect before I show up.

00:13.200 --> 00:18.400
The first thing that's going to happen is a call from me within about 24 hours.

00:18.400 --> 00:21.000
It's short, usually around 5 to 10 minutes.

00:21.000 --> 00:25.720
I just want to learn a little bit about your bathroom and confirm the appointment.

00:25.720 --> 00:26.880
That's it.

00:26.880 --> 00:31.080
After that, we're all set for the in-home visit at the date and time that you chose.

00:31.080 --> 00:33.280
So here's how that usually goes.

00:33.280 --> 00:39.360
I'll show up prepared with my tape measure, my tools, and we'll start with a real conversation.

00:39.360 --> 00:43.280
I want to hear what's been bothering you, what you're hoping to change, and what your

00:43.280 --> 00:44.280
expectations are.

00:44.280 --> 00:48.200
Then I'll take a look at the space, I'll get some measurements, and by the end of the

00:48.200 --> 00:53.040
visit, I'll give you a clear quote so you know exactly what the project will cost before

00:53.040 --> 00:54.440
anything starts.

00:54.440 --> 00:57.880
The whole thing usually takes about 45 minutes, maybe an hour.

00:57.880 --> 01:01.280
But the one thing I want to be upfront about is I am not a salesman.

01:01.280 --> 01:05.440
I am not going to pressure you into signing anything on the spot.

01:05.440 --> 01:09.600
This visit is purely to understand what you need and go over your options.

01:09.600 --> 01:13.720
From there you take the time you need and decide when or if you want to move forward.

01:13.720 --> 01:16.160
No rush, no pressure, ever.
